`, which overshoots and wobbles past rest before settling; each contact kills the prior tween and restarts.\n6. **Player-only** — `if not body is Player: return`, so enemies/projectiles/etc. pass through with no launch or visual reaction.\n\n## Verification\nRan the project via the Godot MCP: the main scene (with all three pads) loads and the script compiles with **zero errors/warnings**. I stopped the run afterward. Note the MCP can't inject input, so I couldn't drive the character onto a pad in an automated way — the runtime behavior rests on the logic above, which fits the existing player/velocity model.\n\nNo other files were changed — only `jumping_pad/jumping_pad.gd`.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"74817858-5a64-4ec6-9fe2-27a540d3f5e5","total_cost_usd":0.8103160000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":42,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42345,"cache_read_input_tokens":562744,"output_tokens":9780,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5053,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":37292},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":940,"cache_read_input_tokens":36823,"cache_creation_input_tokens":469,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":469,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":544,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000629,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":42,"outputTokens":9780,"cacheReadInputTokens":562744,"cacheCreationInputTokens":42345,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8096870000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"c4fcc848-c2a7-447d-9f44-a8f3d7cab315"}
